      "OPENWEBUI_RUNTIME_EVIDENCE_REMAINS_OPEN",
      "NO_SECOND_IDENTITY_CORE_ADI_OR_TOTAL_FIELD",
      "NO_ACTIVATION_RUNTIME_DB_DEPLOY_RESTART_OR_CANONICAL_EFFECT"
    ],
    "failure_behavior": "任一身分根、Session、精確席位、設備信任、同意、意圖、ADI座標、證據或Total Field條件缺失時，縮小投影或HOLD；不得由帳號成功、設備擁有、UI可見或模型輸出補足權威。",
    "prohibited_outputs": [
